  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water, then add a generous pinch of salt.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water over high heat until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the butter and milk to potato and season generously with salt. Mash until smooth. TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/682a92d197a36a9824b41bfe/step-503ac000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, preheat grill to high.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Trim Fioretto. Halve any thicker stalks of Fioretto lengthways. Finely chop brown onion and garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/682a92d197a36a9824b41bfe/step-0fb67910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over high heat.\n• Add veggie mince (no need for oil), carrot and onion and cook, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium then add Aussie spice blend, tomato paste and half the garlic and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the brown sugar, chicken stock pot and water, stirring, until slightly reduced, 2-3 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/682a92d197a36a9824b41bfe/step-833ff020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer the veggie mince filling to a baking dish, then spread mashed potato over the top, smoothing it out with the back of a spoon.\n• Sprinkle over Cheddar cheese.\n• Grill pie until the cheese is melted and golden, 8-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/682a92d197a36a9824b41bfe/step-071f4830.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While pie is grilling, wash out frying pan and return to medium heat with a good drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients), stirring, until golden brown, 2 minutes.\n• Add remaining garlic and a pinch of chilli flakes and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a bowl and season to taste.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook Fioretto, until tender, 5-6 minutes. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/682a92d197a36a9824b41bfe/step-eff58d40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide classic plant-based mince and cheesy potato top pie and sauteed Fioretto between plates.\n• Top Fioretto with chilli-garlic pangrattato. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/682a92d197a36a9824b41bfe/step-5dcab050.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
